   THE ORDER CHANNEL: A's outcome flips with B's setting on 0 of 64 births at a = 0 and 0 at a = N/4; B's flips with A's setting on 0 of 64 at b = N/8 and 44 at b = 3N/8 (0.0000, 0.0000, 0.0000, 0.6875 of the births)
